Prose is running text: an overview or explanation of a few short paragraphs under a section heading.

- Markup: `<div class="aq-prose">` with `<p>` paragraphs, inside an `aq-section` after an `<h2 class="aq-h1">`.
- Width is capped at `text-max` (about 65 characters). Paragraphs are spaced `space-4`.
- Two to four paragraphs. One idea per paragraph; lead with the outcome, then the evidence and the standard.
- If you're writing a list of items with titles, use LinkGrid or OptionList instead.
- Use it inside a SplitSection: heading left, text right, first paragraph as the 20 px takeaway. Two short paragraphs is the norm; past three, split the content into an OptionList or a table.
